  "liner": {
   "body_md": "This archive entry captures a live performance by Mountain Goats at the Zwijnzicht venue in Dordrecht, recorded on Saturday, November 9, 1996 [1]. The upload, identified as tmg1996-11-09, consists of a single track with a total runtime of forty-eight minutes [1]. This specific file is the only archived recording of this particular show, making it the primary source for listeners interested in this date [1]. Within the broader collection of Mountain Goats materials on the Internet Archive, this performance is cataloged as the eleventh show out of a total of 467 entries [2]. The most recent archived show preceding this one took place on November 7, 1996, at VPRO [2]. The single song included in this recording is listed in the setlist as mountain3 [1]. This track is noted as the first in the archive and is described as legendary because it represents the only archived performance of that specific song [1]. The uploader’s description confirms the event as Mountain Goats Live at Zwijnzicht, Dordrecht on 1996-11-09 [1]. No additional details regarding the source of the audio or other setlist items are provided in the available metadata [1]. Listeners should note that the recording contains just this one extended piece, offering a focused glimpse into the band's live presence during this period [1].",
